.TH NEO-CLOCK-ALARMS 1 "2026-11-10" "gnome-phone 0.1.0" "GNOME Phone"
.SH NAME
neo-clock-alarms \- alarm and timer service of the GNOME Phone clock
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B neo-clock-alarms
.SH DESCRIPTION
Rings alarms and timers and keeps the stopwatch with the clock app closed, and asks neo-wakeup to wake the phone for each alarm. It runs as the systemd user service neo-clock-alarms.service and owns neo.Clock.Alarms on the session bus.
.SH SEE ALSO
neo-clock(1), neo-wakeup(8)
